WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:15.086
elephant pointed at Wukong.

2
00:00:15.726 --> 00:00:16.947
"He's not a demon.

3
00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:18.668
He's a monkey!"

4
00:00:20.268 --> 00:00:22.469
not just a monkey," said the raptor.

5
00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.610
"He's Sun Wukong.

6
00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:25.651
Get him!"

7
00:00:26.811 --> 00:00:27.932
The lion pounced.

8
00:00:31.128 --> 00:00:34.209
Wukong shot out of the cave as fast as he could.

9
00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.811
He didn't stop running until he was far from the cave.

10
00:00:45.172 --> 00:00:46.412
the monkey said to himself.

11
00:00:47.573 --> 00:00:48.253
was close.

12
00:00:48.913 --> 00:00:51.074
I guess when I laughed I broke my concentration.

13
00:00:52.134 --> 00:00:54.075
That must have made my disguise vanish."

14
00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.356
Wukong returned to his companions.

15
00:01:01.088 --> 00:01:02.549
"Well?" said Wujing.

16
00:01:02.569 --> 00:01:04.651
"Is there an army up ahead?"

17
00:01:04.671 --> 00:01:09.454
"I scared away the entire army," Wukong boasted.

18
00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:12.876
"But there are still three powerful demons on the mountain.

19
00:01:13.917 --> 00:01:17.279
They plan to capture Master and, well eat him."

20
00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:21.342
cried the Tang Monk, nearly falling over.

21
00:01:21.362 --> 00:01:23.544
Wujing caught him.

22
00:01:25.245 --> 00:01:27.406
worry, Master," said Wukong.

23
00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.596
"We won't let those demons harm you.

24
00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:33.217
But we do have to destroy them before we cross the mountain.

25
00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:37.219
It's good that we discovered their plan before we went up the mountain."

26
00:01:37.999 --> 00:01:41.261
The Tang Monk nodded, wringing his hands nervously.

27
00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:44.642
Wukong turned to Bajie and Wujing.

28
00:01:44.662 --> 00:01:47.763
"Someone needs to help me get rid of the demons."

29
00:01:49.264 --> 00:01:51.005
"I'll go with you," said Bajie.

30
00:01:51.025 --> 00:01:54.806
"I'll stay here and look after the Tang Monk," said Wujing.

31
00:01:56.227 --> 00:01:58.828
Wukong and Bajie went to the cave entrance.

32
00:02:02.084 --> 00:02:03.966
monkey pulled out his iron bar.

33
00:02:04.706 --> 00:02:06.568
Bajie raised his rake.

34
00:02:07.449 --> 00:02:09.791
"I'll do all the talking," said Wukong.

35
00:02:10.671 --> 00:02:11.952
"What are you going to say?"

36
00:02:12.253 --> 00:02:13.093
asked Bajie.

37
00:02:13.113 --> 00:02:16.977
"I'll just ask them nicely to leave," said Wukong.

38
00:02:17.997 --> 00:02:19.359
turned to the cave entrance.

39
00:02:19.379 --> 00:02:22.221
"Demons!" he shouted.

40
00:02:22.982 --> 00:02:26.805
"Leave this mountain now, or we'll knock it down and crush all three of you!"

41
00:02:28.546 --> 00:02:30.388
a moment everything was quiet.

42
00:02:32.396 --> 00:02:34.337
Then the lion stepped out of the cave.

43
00:02:35.538 --> 00:02:38.139
He towered over the monkey and the pig.

44
00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.661
"Why are you out here yelling?"

45
00:02:42.342 --> 00:02:43.543
asked the lion calmly.

46
00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:49.806
"You, the elephant, and the raptor must leave this mountain at once," said Wukong.

47
00:02:51.627 --> 00:02:52.748
must we leave?"

48
00:02:53.308 --> 00:02:54.089
asked the lion.

49
00:02:54.109 --> 00:02:56.570
"We're not bothering you."

50
00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.732
"Villain!" shouted the monkey.

51
00:03:00.432 --> 00:03:02.773
"I know you're planning to capture and eat the Tang Monk!"

52
00:03:03.794 --> 00:03:07.315
"We haven't touched the Tang Monk," said the lion.

53
00:03:07.335 --> 00:03:14.058
"But you, Sun Wukong—you scared away our entire army.

54
00:03:14.079 --> 00:03:16.800
You're the villain here."

55
00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:20.181
"I'm not a villain!"

56
00:03:20.502 --> 00:03:21.482
shouted Wukong.

57
00:03:22.282 --> 00:03:25.444
He raised his iron bar and charged toward the lion.

58
00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:32.003
The lion opened his mouth wide, revealing huge, sharp fangs.

59
00:03:34.784 --> 00:03:36.105
swung his iron bar.

60
00:03:38.126 --> 00:03:44.731
The lion pounced Bajie's face went white with horror.

61
00:03:44.751 --> 00:03:46.592
"Yikes!" he cried.

62
00:03:46.612 --> 00:03:49.494
"That lion just swallowed Wukong!"

63
00:03:51.135 --> 00:03:53.036
The pig ran as fast as he could.

64
00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:57.661
He didn't stop running until he reached Wujing and the Tang Monk.

65
00:03:58.621 --> 00:04:00.782
"What happened?"

66
00:04:01.062 --> 00:04:01.882
asked Wujing.

67
00:04:01.902 --> 00:04:03.183
"Where's Wukong?"

68
00:04:03.203 --> 00:04:10.025
"The journey is over," said the pig between breaths.

69
00:04:10.045 --> 00:04:14.146
"Wukong got eaten!"

70
00:04:15.326 --> 00:04:16.946
"What!" cried the Tang Monk.

71
00:04:18.907 --> 00:04:19.587
shook his head.

72
00:04:19.607 --> 00:04:24.148
"We should all just go home."

73
00:04:24.228 --> 00:04:26.730
Meanwhile the lion went back into the cave.

74
00:04:29.531 --> 00:04:32.913
His chest was puffed out, and he wore a big smile.

75
00:04:32.933 --> 00:04:35.114
"What happened out there?"

76
00:04:35.415 --> 00:04:36.215
asked the elephant.

77
00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:38.937
"Did you scare away Sun Wukong?"

78
00:04:38.957 --> 00:04:42.719
"Not exactly," said the lion.

79
00:04:42.739 --> 00:04:45.941
"Well, where is he?"

80
00:04:46.341 --> 00:04:47.101
asked the raptor.

81
00:04:48.522 --> 00:04:49.723
lion patted his belly.

82
00:04:49.743 --> 00:04:53.692
"He's in here."

83
00:04:54.152 --> 00:04:54.873
"You ate him?"

84
00:04:55.233 --> 00:04:56.073
asked the elephant.

85
00:04:57.673 --> 00:04:59.794
"I did," said the lion.

86
00:05:01.935 --> 00:05:03.075
raptor shook his head.

87
00:05:03.095 --> 00:05:06.136
"That was a bad idea."

88
00:05:08.537 --> 00:05:10.297
"Why?" asked the lion.

89
00:05:10.317 --> 00:05:14.259
"Sun Wukong is immortal," said the raptor.

90
00:05:14.279 --> 00:05:18.180
"He's probably still alive inside you."

91
00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.015
I am still alive!"

92
00:05:22.275 --> 00:05:23.960
Wukong suddenly shouted.

93
00:05:24.983 --> 00:05:26.668
"It's nice and warm in here!"
